"The iSCSI target for the LUN has been added to the cluster (see `Adding "
"iSCSI Targets`_ below)"
msgstr "O destino iSCSI do LUN foi adicionado ao cluster (consulte `Adding iSCSI Targets`_ abaixo)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:144
